Package: vabaxos-lessons
Architecture: all
Maintainer: VabaxOS <https://github.com/Vabax-dev/VabaxOS>
Section: education
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1
Description: Learn the keys of VabaxOS, with exercises
 Short lessons (moving in a window, writing, copy and paste, windows and
 desktop, the screen reader, VabaxOS tools): press the key asked, and the
 voice says "Right!" or which key you pressed. Keys taken by the desktop or
 the screen reader are tried, and their effect is the answer. Opens by
 itself at the first login of the installed system.
